# stiva run-path test suite — Cyrius port
# Split out of tests/stiva.tcyr: the monolith hit the cycc identifier
# dedup cap (16384). Run both via `cyrius tests tests/`.
# Mirrors rust-old runtime.rs run-path (generate_spec/send_signal/cgroups/build_sandbox).

